  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Reform Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of HSMS SECAL is to support comprehensive health sector reforms that promote fiscal sustainability while continuing to provide quality health care services and financial protection for the population. The overarching objectives are to: (i) improve fiscal discipline through structural changes in the health sector that will alleviate the chronic problem of arrears in the health sectorcomma encourage greater technical and allocative efficiency and institute a system that will promote fiscal sustainability; (ii) improve the quality and cost-effectiveness of the health sector; and (iii) mitigate any possible negative impacts on health care accesscomma specially for vulnerable populations.</narrative>
  </description>
